    "asset_id": "78b87973-15b2-4406-ba7f-97bb627a75aa",
    "span_ref": "section:1.2:paragraph:0002",
    "content_type": "text",
    "content": "1. `pg_stat_statements` shows `SELECT * FROM order_events WHERE order_id = $1 ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 1` as the dominant query.\n2. `EXPLAIN ANALYZE` reports row estimate mismatch (~30x) on the `order_events` table.\n3. Buffer reads spike during replay windows after deploy.",
    "speaker": null,
    "confidence": 0.86,
    "tags": [
      "section_path:1.2",
