  {
    "asset_id": "78b87973-15b2-4406-ba7f-97bb627a75aa",
    "span_ref": "section:1.3:paragraph:0003",
    "content_type": "text",
    "content": "1. Refresh table statistics before adding indexes.\n2. Add one composite index only if estimate mismatch remains after stats refresh.\n3. Verify p95 latency and buffer hit ratio before and after change.",
